{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Planning estimate for a flat rectangular wall. Openings are reduced by area; positions, broken lines, angles, lintels, cutouts, binding patterns and structural requirements are not modelled. Mortar volumes are geometric and pocket closures vary by product and technique. Verify dimensions and closures with suppliers; consult with certified masons for construction decisions.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"brick-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"brick-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["brick-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Perkiraan perencanaan untuk dinding persegi panjang datar. Pembukaan dikurangi berdasarkan area; posisinya, jalur terputus, sudut, lintel, potongan, pola ikatan dan persyaratan struktural tidak dimodelkan. Volume mortar adalah geometris dan penutupan kantong bervariasi menurut produk dan teknik. Verifikasi dimensi dan penutupan dengan pemasok; konsultasikan dengan tukang batu bersertifikat untuk keputusan konstruksi.","record_id":"0433ef8baea5a0654336d3622be8327b25e9f4155df398462dea0050dfd55d22","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":3.941672186874996,"source":"Planning estimate for a flat rectangular wall. Openings are deducted by area; their position, interrupted courses, corners, lintels, cuts, bond pattern and structural requirements are not modeled. Mortar volume is geometric and bag coverage varies by product and technique. Verify dimensions and coverage with the supplier; consult a qualified mason for construction decisions.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"b36f48ea79bc88a360c3a59d5b7905baee16ebfc6a433999163048505aecd0